    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 093 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(What do I do in the evening?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "After finishing classes at the academies, I go home and have"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "dinner with my family."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My mother always makes dinner."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "When we eat,my father usually talks about his day,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and we share our experiences."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After dinner, we watch television together."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My favorite TV shows are Miracle and Fantastic."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I start my homework at around 9:00 p.m."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My English homework is my favorite."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "It is my favorite because it is easier than my other subjects."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After that, I quickly write in my journal about my day."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I go to bed at about 10:30 p.m."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and think what a wonderful day it was!"
    },
